cff-version: 1.2.0
# The atlas table is regenerated by code/build_atlas.py and is not tracked in
# this repository. It has no persistent identifier until it is deposited, so a
# citation of it names the commit of the repository that produced the copy
# used. The identifier, version and release date are set at deposit.
message: "If you use the atlas table, cite it as below, with the commit of the repository that produced the copy you used."
title: "bdq-cfz-mic-atlas atlas table (outputs/atlas_evidence.csv): per-variant evidence and bedaquiline and clofazimine MIC shifts for Rv0678, pepQ and atpE variants in Mycobacterium tuberculosis"
abstract: >-
  One row per distinct mutation in Rv0678, pepQ and atpE carried by a solo
  isolate in the CRyPTIC Consortium Dataset v3.4.0, with its isolate and cluster
  counts, the sites and sublineages it spans, and its resistant and censored
  counts for each drug. Where the independent evidence supports one, a row
  carries the shift in fitted mean log2 MIC against the reference group, with
  an interval from resampling clusters; a row without one records why it is
  withheld. docs/DATA_DICTIONARY.md defines every column. Resistance in this
  collection is concentrated at one site by design, so no count in the table is
  a prevalence estimate.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Baktiyarova"
    given-names: "Amina"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-6265-6493"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/aminabaktiyarova/bdq-cfz-mic-atlas"
keywords:
  - tuberculosis
  - bedaquiline
  - clofazimine
  - minimum inhibitory concentration
  - Rv0678
  - pepQ
  - atpE
  - interval censoring
  - genotype-phenotype association
references:
  - type: data
    title: "The CRyPTIC Consortium Dataset"
    version: "v3.4.0"
    doi: "10.5281/zenodo.15680920"
    license: CC-BY-4.0
    authors:
      - name: "The CRyPTIC Consortium"
      - family-names: "Fowler"
        given-names: "Philip"
        orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0912-4483"
  - type: software
    title: "bdq-cfz-mic-atlas: a quantitative atlas of Rv0678 and MmpL5 mutation effects on bedaquiline and clofazimine MICs"
    license: MIT
    repository-code: "https://github.com/aminabaktiyarova/bdq-cfz-mic-atlas"
    authors:
